Tsuru: Very well. The kitchen has to be the first to get ready so that Rosinante can get to cooking.
Tsuru: Let's get started.
Tsuru: I will need your help all around, {$name}!
{$name}: I'd prefer to...
-> ...wash the floors!
    Tsuru: I appreciate that, but I would rather do that.
    Tsuru: There is no way to clean this mess without a Devil Fruit... but it is very nice of you to volunteer. (Loop back) //HOW DO??
-> ...do the inventory for cutlery!
    <<jump workday_legendary_4_invent>>
