    <<jump workday_legendary_4_dishwashing>>
Tsuru: Let's get to work.
===

title: workday_legendary_4_invent
location: mess hall
---
Tsuru: Going over the available supplies... This is a good idea.
Tsuru: Follow me, {$name}.
Across a hall, you stroll behind Tsuru, your boots sticking now and then to the grime-encrusted floors.
Tsuru: It doesn't look like anybody has been using this soup kitchen...
-> Try to make small talk.
    {$name}: Have you ever been to this region before?
    Tsuru: Not outside of the last years' volunteering, no.
    Tsuru: Which is not to say it isn't a nice place... A calm corner of the seas.
-> Ask about past experiences in this soup kitchen.
    <<set lwd4T_points +=1>>
    {$name}: Is this something you do very often?
    Tsuru: Under Sengoku, we always did.
    Tsuru: And well... Under Sakazuki, we do try to, but it isn't a high priority anymore.
    Tsuru: For Sengoku, it was very important not to lose touch with civilians... With the real impact of the decisions we make.
-> Remark on the lack of maintenance.
    <<set lwd4T_points -=1>>
    {$name}: It doesn't look like whoever is in charge cares much about cleaning the soup kitchen, that's for sure.
    Tsuru: ...
    Tsuru: You're not wrong. But let's try not to point it out in front of our men... Or civilians, for that matter.
A flickering light bounces off dull metal. Heaps of rusty pots and greasy pans greet you...
And the cutlery seems to be coated with dust.
Tsuru: Hmm.
{$name}: It seems like...
-> ...more than enough to start!
    <<set lwd4T_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: You might be too optimistic, {$name}. This kitchen is in no condition to cook.
    Tsuru: Call your men. I'll take the floors, and you do the dishes, fast.
-> ...more work than we expected!
    <<set lwd4T_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Exactly what I was thinking.
    Tsuru: Get ahold of a couple of officers, {$name}.
<<jump workday_legendary_4_dishes_a>>
===

title: workday_legendary_4_dishwashing
location: mess hall
---

Tsuru: Hm. Supervising sounds like an excuse to play hooky.
-> You get nervous.
    <<set lwd4T_points -=1>>
    {$name}: N-no! I'd never make excuses in a matter as serious as this—
    Tsuru:...
    Tsuru: Don't make me actually suspicious by reacting like that.
    Tsuru: After all, I was going to say that I trust you to do a good job, {$name}. Don't disappoint me.
-> You stay calm.
    <<set lwd4T_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: However, I trust you with this task.
    Tsuru: Thank you for volunteering.
Motioning to the two officers that offered to help, you enter the kitchen.
A flickering light overhead reveals heaps of kitchenware on squalid shelves. It looks like somebody may have made an attempt on sorting it out before leaving it there for years.
Marine B: Ugh... These plates are sticky.
Marine A: Is the pan supposed to look like this?
Marine B: I think there's a whole family of rats living under the cupboard...
There seems to be quite a lot to do before the cooking can start.
-> Ask Tsuru for help.
    You're about to turn around but then decide...
    She probably won't be too happy without you at least trying.
-> Find the right products to clean the kitchenware.
    {$name}: Attention, officers!
    {$name}: No more complaining. Let's get to business.
    The officers straighten up and salute. Hey, this is working well!
    As one of them opens the door to a cupboard, a big cloud of dust tickles your nose.
    Marine B: Hey, boss, it seems like I found some cleaning stuff right here...
    Marine B: Hmmm... The label says “vinegar”...
    -> Yes, that should work!
        Marine B: Huh... OK... Is this all we need?
        -> Yes, that's it!
            <<jump workday_legendary_4_dishwashing_neutral>>
        -> No, let's keep on looking.
            <<jump workday_legendary_4_dishes_a>>
