        {$name}: Just mix whatever you find in a bucket!
        <<jump workday_legendary_4_dishes_chaos>>
-> Try to scrub the rust off the pans.
    {$name}: Everybody! Just follow my lead!
    {$name}: It only takes some hot water and scrubbing...
    Marine A: Uh... Officer, that does not look too good.
    Marine B: (I hope they know what they are doing...)
