title: workday_legendary_4_dishes_chaos
location: mess hall
---

Marine B: All I find, huh? Like...
Marine B: Huh... Disinfectant...
Marine B: And bleach... And all-purpose cleaner... Wait, there's a few of these...
Marine B just squeezes all of them into a bucket of water.
The smell it lets out is quite strong... Acidic, in fact. Your eyes and nose itch.
Marine A: Huh... No offense but...
Marine A: This stinks!
Marine B: Hey, twice as much stink is half the work, am I right–
You can't breathe this in!
The three of you bolt toward the exit and take a lungful of clean clean air.
You pant... And breathe... And breathe...
Tsuru: {$name}? Is everything OK?
Tsuru: What is that smell?
The officers you were supposed to be supervising burst out the door, panting and coughing.
(At least they have evacuated the rat family.)
They both point at each other and exclaim in unison:
Marines A & B: It was him!
Tsuru: This is ridiculous.
Tsuru: Now we have to clean your *alleged* cleaning...
<<jump workday_legendary_4_mid_Day_Break_Switch>>
===

title: workday_legendary_4_dishes_neutral
