---

With the items you selected, the cleaning is going well.
Except... It's taking it more than you expected.
Marine A: Aw... My hands are all dry... Can you believe it?
Marine B: Think you're supposed to put on some gloves...
Tsuru: Hello, {$name}.
Tsuru: Hm... I was quite expecting this to be done by now.
Tsuru: Well. Leave me to it.
You hope she's not too disappointed...
<<jump workday_legendary_4_mid_Day_Break_Switch>>
===

title: workday_legendary_4_dishwashing_neutral_B
