With the items you selected, the cleaning is going well!
Everything is starting to look clearer... The prospect of cooking with this stuff is not so dire anymore.
Marine A: Huh... Just a bit more to do!
Marine B: Almost done with the dryin', boss!
Tsuru: How is it going, {$name}?
