He continues to mumble, annoyed, but he brings a broom to clean everything up. It takes a while, since there are quite a lot of shards that need sweeping. You only watch him do it.
Finally, he is done!
Rosinante: That would have been more efficient if you'd helped.
{$name}: I would have just gotten in your way.
Rosinante: I think you need to learn to talk to your superiors, {$name}.
{$name}: Let's just focus on getting everything ready.
{$name}: We've wasted enough time already.
Rosinante: Fine. Do you have anything in mind?
-> You should pour the soup. I'll bring them over to the window so we can avoid other disasters.
    <<set lwd4R_points -=1>>
    <<jump workday_legendary_4_Rosi_Pour>>
-> Someone needs to get the soup ready. The other one will set it by the window.
    <<set lwd4R_points +=1>>
    <<jump workday_legendary_4_Player_Pour>>
